{
  "slug": "qlik-agents",
  "name": "Qlik Agents",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "Multi-agent development pipeline for Qlik Sense. 9-phase workflow from requirements through documentation, powered by practitioner-authored Qlik knowledge.",
  "longDescription": "Ships **14 skills**, **8 agents** and **1 hook**.\n\n- **Skills** (14): `data-quality-validator` (Post-load data quality validation patterns for Qlik development), `platform-conventions` (Captures existing platform patterns for brownfield Qlik projects), `qlik-cloud-mcp` (Capability registry for the Qlik Cloud MCP server), `qlik-data-modeling` (Star schema patterns, key resolution strategies, synthetic key prevention, QVD layer design, multi-app architecture patterns, source architecture consumption…), `qlik-deploy` (Deployment procedures for Qlik Sense Cloud and client-managed environments), `qlik-expressions` (Set analysis syntax and patterns, aggregation functions, TOTAL qualifier usage, Aggr() patterns, conditional expressions, null handling in expressions,…), `qlik-load-script` (Script syntax reference, QVD optimization, incremental load patterns (insert-only, insert/update, insert/update/delete, dual-timestamp for SCD2), master calendar generation, variable…), `qlik-naming-conventions` (Field naming with entity-prefix dot notation, table naming, variable naming (v prefix), expression naming, file naming (.qvs, QVD),…), and 6 more\n- **Agents** (8): `data-architect` (Designs complete data architecture including app architecture strategy, star schema, ETL pipeline with layer boundaries, QVD layer strategy,…), `doc-writer` (Generates complete project documentation from all pipeline artifacts), `expression-developer` (Authors all Qlik Sense expressions including master measures, master dimensions, calculated dimensions, set analysis expressions, variable expressions, and…), `orchestrator` (Project manager for the Qlik development pipeline), `qa-reviewer` (Reviews all Qlik development artifacts against best practices, naming conventions, script quality, expression correctness, security, and cross-artifact consistency), `requirements-analyst` (Conducts structured discovery for Qlik Sense projects), `script-developer` (Writes production-grade Qlik Sense load scripts (.qvs files) from the data architect's model specification), `viz-architect` (Designs Qlik Sense sheet layouts, visualization selections, filter panes, navigation flow, and user experience)\n- **Hooks** (1): `PostToolUse`\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install qlik-agents@claude-community` from `Pupfish-LLC/qlik-agents`.",
  "compatibility": [
    "claude"
  ],
  "pluginType": "package",
  "package": {
    "skill": 14,
    "agent": 8,
    "hook": 1
  },
  "sourceType": "community",
